bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Text Editor" as Editor
boundary Router
control SpellCheckController
control SpellCheckService
entity "Spell (nspell instance)" as Spell

User -> Editor: 1. Submit check spelling
activate User
activate Editor

Editor -> Router: 2. POST /api/spellcheck/check
activate Router

Router -> SpellCheckController: 3. check(dto)
activate SpellCheckController

SpellCheckController -> SpellCheckService: 4. checkText(dto)
activate SpellCheckService

SpellCheckService -> SpellCheckService: 5. Check dictionary loaded
activate SpellCheckService
space
deactivate SpellCheckService

alt Dictionary not loaded
    SpellCheckService --> SpellCheckController: 5.1 throw error
    SpellCheckController --> Router: 5.2 HTTP 500
    Router --> Editor: 5.3 Show error
    Editor --> User: 5.4 Show error
end

SpellCheckService -> Spell: 6. correct(wordLower) and suggest(wordLower)
activate Spell
Spell --> SpellCheckService: 7. suggestions[]
deactivate Spell

SpellCheckService --> SpellCheckController: 8. Return { original, errors(word, offset, length, suggestions) }
deactivate SpellCheckService

SpellCheckController --> Router: 9. HTTP 200
deactivate SpellCheckController

Router --> Editor: 10. Render result
deactivate Router
Editor --> User: 11. Render result
deactivate Editor
deactivate User